              "content": "=The user have a tech question from Connectively. You have to response if the user can answer the question depending on my background below.\n\n<THE-USER-BACKGROUND-IS-HERE>\n\nYour response should be short but useful.\nDo not answer the question from user message. Only suggest if I should answer by myself or not.\nFormat: Return ONLY a valid JSON object. No prose.\nThe question we need to decide if i should answer or not:  {{ $json.question }}\n\nJSON schema:\n{\n  \"should_answer\": \"boolean\",\n  \"message\": \"string\"\n}"
